109	3	22	V	Frequency Array	https://codeforces.com/group/MWSDmqGsZm/contest/219774/problem/V	{"meta": {"title": "V. Frequency Array", "inputType": "standard input", "timeLimit": "1 second", "outputType": "standard output", "memoryLimit": "256 megabytes", "timeLimitMs": 1000, "memoryLimitMB": 256}, "note": "<p>Numbers from 1 to 5 appearance are : </p><ul> <li> 1 appears <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">2</span> times in the array . </li><li> 2 appears <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">2</span> times in the array. </li><li> 3 appears <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">3</span> times in the array. </li><li> 4 appears <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">once</span> in the array. </li><li> 5 appears <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">2</span> times in the array. </li></ul>", "type": "problem", "story": "<div><p>Given <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">2</span> numbers <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(N\\\\)</span>, <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(M\\\\)</span> and an array <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(A\\\\)</span> of <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(N\\\\)</span> numbers. For every number from <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">1</span> to <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(M\\\\)</span>, print how many times this number <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">appears</span> in this array.</p></div>", "inputSpec": "<p>First line contains two numbers <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(N\\\\)</span>, <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(M\\\\)</span> <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\((1 \\\\le N \\\\le 10^5, 1 \\\\le M \\\\le 10^5)\\\\)</span>.</p><p>Second line contains <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(N\\\\)</span> numbers <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\((1 \\\\le A_i \\\\le M)\\\\)</span>.</p>", "testCases": [{"id": 1, "input": "10 5\\n1 2 3 4 5 3 2 1 5 3", "output": "2\\n2\\n3\\n1\\n2"}], "outputSpec": "<p>Print <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(M\\\\)</span> lines, the <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(i_{th}\\\\)</span> line should contain number of times that the number <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(i\\\\)</span> appears in <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(A\\\\)</span></p>"}	\N	800	219774
