140	4	20	T	URL	https://codeforces.com/group/MWSDmqGsZm/contest/219856/problem/T	{"meta": {"title": "T. URL", "inputType": "standard input", "timeLimit": "1 second", "outputType": "standard output", "memoryLimit": "256 megabytes", "timeLimitMs": 1000, "memoryLimitMB": 256}, "note": null, "type": "problem", "story": "<div><p>Given a string <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(S\\\\)</span> that represents a <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">URL</span> request. Print five lines contains the following format: \\"<span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(X\\\\)</span>: <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(Y\\\\)</span>\\" where <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(X\\\\)</span> is the parameter and <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(Y\\\\)</span> is the parameter value.</p><p><span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">Note:</span> The parameters of the <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">URL</span>: <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">username</span>, <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">pwd</span>, <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">profile</span>, <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">role</span> and <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">key</span>.</p></div>", "inputSpec": "<p>Only one line contains a string <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(S\\\\)</span> <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\((100 \\\\le |S| \\\\le 10^4)\\\\)</span> where |S| is the length of the string and it consists of <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">uppercase</span> and <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">lowercase</span> English letters, <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">digits</span>, and <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">special characters</span>.</p><p>The URL will be in the following format:</p><p>http://www.{word}.{word}/{word}/{word}?username={word}&amp;pwd={word}&amp;profile={word}&amp;role={word}&amp;key={word}</p><p><span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">It's guaranteed that all parameters will have a value</span>.</p>", "testCases": [{"id": 1, "input": "http://www.cleartrip.com/signin