9*<span class=\\"tex-span\\">10<sup class=\\"upper-index\\">3</sup></span>)</p>", "testCases": [{"id": 1, "input": "20 2\\n1 3\\n1 5", "output": "10\\n28"}], "outputSpec": "<p>For each <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>Q</i><sub class=\\"lower-index\\"><i>i</i></sub></span> output the sum for <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>L</i><sub class=\\"lower-index\\"><i>i</i></sub></span> to <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>R</i><sub class=\\"lower-index\\"><i>i</i></sub></span> . Note : indexed from 1 </p>"}	\N	\N	318121
