162	3	10	J	Lucky Array	https://codeforces.com/group/MWSDmqGsZm/contest/219774/problem/J	{"meta": {"title": "J. Lucky Array", "inputType": "standard input", "timeLimit": "1 second", "outputType": "standard output", "memoryLimit": "256 megabytes", "timeLimitMs": 1000, "memoryLimitMB": 256}, "note": "<p><span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">First Example</span> :</p><p>minimum element is <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">5</span> and its frequency is <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">1</span> and it's ODD so the array is <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">lucky</span>.</p><p><span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">Second Example</span> :</p><p>minimum element is <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">3</span> and its frequency is <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">4</span> and it's EVEN so the array is <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">not lucky</span>.</p>", "type": "problem", "story": "<div><p>Given a number <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>N</i></span> and an array <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>A</i></span> of <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>N</i></span> numbers. Determine if the array is <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">lucky</span> or <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">not</span>. </p><p><span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">Note:</span> the array is <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">lucky</span> if the <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">frequency</span> (number of occurrence) of the <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">minimum element</span> is <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">odd</span>.</p></div>", "inputSpec": "<p>First line contains a number <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>N</i></span> <span class=\\"tex-span\\">(2 ≤ <i>N</i> ≤ 1000)</span> number of elements.</p><p>Second line contains <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>N</i></span> numbers <span class=\\"tex-span\\">( - 10<sup class=\\"upper-index\\">5</sup> ≤ <i>A</i><sub class=\\"lower-index\\"><i>i</i></sub> ≤ 10<sup class=\\"upper-index\\">5</sup>)</span>.</p>", "testCases": [{"id": 1, "input": "5\\n8 8 9 5 9", "output": "Lucky"}, {"id": 2, "input": "5\\n3 3 3 5 3", "output": "Unlucky"}], "outputSpec": "<p>Print \\"<span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">Lucky</span>\\" (without quotes) if the frequency of the <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">minimum element</span> is <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">odd</span>, otherwise print \\"<span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">Unlucky</span>\\"(without quotes).</p>"}	\N	2400	219774
