\\"><i>S</i></span> <span class=\\"tex-span\\">(1 ≤ |<i>S</i>| ≤ 10<sup class=\\"upper-index\\">4</sup>)</span> where |S| is the length of the string and it consists of <span class=\\"tex-font-style-bf\\">lowercase</span> English letters.</p>", "testCases": [{"id": 1, "input": "acmicpc", "output": "acccimp"}], "outputSpec": "<p>Print the smallest string that can be obtained.</p>"}	\N	800	219856
