pan class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>i</i></span>th of the next <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>N</i></span> lines contains two integers <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>t</i><sub class=\\"lower-index\\"><i>i</i></sub></span> (<span class=\\"tex-span\\">1 ≤ <i>t</i><sub class=\\"lower-index\\"><i>i</i></sub> ≤ 100</span>) and <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>s</i><sub class=\\"lower-index\\"><i>i</i></sub></span> (<span class=\\"tex-span\\">1 ≤ <i>s</i><sub class=\\"lower-index\\"><i>i</i></sub> ≤ 100</span>), the information of <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>i</i></span>th participant. <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>K</i></span> is a multiple of <span class=\\"tex-span\\"><i>A</i></span>.</p>", "testCases": [{"id": 1, "input": "2 100 1\\n10 5\\n5 10", "output": "145"}, {"id": 2, "input": "4 100 2\\n30 30\\n49 2\\n50 50\\n20 10", "output": "50"}], "outputSpec": "<p>Write a single integer, the answer to the question.</p>"}	\N	\N	309967
