inline-math\\">\\\\(s\\\\)</span> and <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(t\\\\)</span> respectively, each of them will consists from only lower case English letters.</p><p>The last line of each test case will contain <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(n\\\\)</span> integers <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(id_1, id_2, ..., id_n\\\\)</span> <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\((1 \\\\leq id_i \\\\leq 10^5)\\\\)</span>.</p>", "testCases": [{"id": 1, "input": "2\\n5\\nabcdd\\ncdabd\\n1 1 1 1 5\\n5\\nabcdd\\ncdabd\\n1 2 1 3 5", "output": "YES\\nNO"}], "outputSpec": "<p>For each test case, output one line contains \\"YES\\" if you can convert the string <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(s\\\\)</span> to the string <span class=\\"cf-inline-math\\">\\\\(t\\\\)</span>, otherwise output \\"NO\\".</p>"}	\N	1900	374321
